OL,3,GNEWSASecurity bolstered to stop
OL,4,ADebenhams trespassers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe firm that manages the former
OL,7,FDebenhams building in Nottingham city
OL,8,Fcentre says it has bolstered security
OL,9,Fand warned trespassers they are putting
OL,10,Flives at risk.
OL,12,FNottinghamshire Police has frequently
OL,13,Fbeen called to reports of children and
OL,14,Fyoung people entering the building in
OL,15,FLong Row, off Old Market Square, with
OL,16,Fsome accessing the roof.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
