OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSASecurity bolstered to stop
OL,4,ADebenhams trespassers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA closure order has been extended to 20
OL,7,FNovember and Longmead Capital - which
OL,8,Fmanages the building on behalf of the
OL,9,Fowner - said it had brought in a
OL,10,F24-hour security patrol, upgraded CCTV
OL,11,Fand added anti-climb paint.
OL,13,FIt comes after Neghat Khan, leader of
OL,14,FNottingham City Council, warned it was
OL,15,F"a matter of time" before somebody died
OL,16,Fthere.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
